    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 id="chain-title">Where do you sit in the chain?</h2>
      <p>A 2015 trade report on Delhi's auto parts market, including a distributor's Kashmiri Gate outlet, describes distributors supplying semi-wholesalers and retailers, with products reaching small retailers and mechanics. The accounting points are our general analysis.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="data-table-wrap" tabindex="0" aria-label="Positions in the supply chain and what matters to each, scrolls sideways on small screens">
